OL,3,AChris Mason: Burnham faces crunch
OL,4,Adecisions in his next 100 days
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis feels like the week where the
OL,7,Frubber hits the road for the prime
OL,8,Fminister's new government.
OL,10,FIt is now 100 days since Andy Burnham
OL,11,Farrived in Downing Street from
OL,12,FBuckingham Palace and began to assemble
OL,13,Fhis cabinet.
OL,15,FThree months later, Labour MPs are more
OL,16,Fchipper, the party's poll ratings have
OL,17,Fnotched up and the tone and style of
OL,18,Fgovernment feels very different from
OL,19,Fwhen Sir Keir Starmer was in charge.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
