OL,3,ABudget measures to include fuel duty
OL,4,Afreeze and food tariff cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaking higher tax-free mileage rates
OL,7,Fpermanent and the removal of import
OL,8,Ftaxes on some food items are among the
OL,9,Fmeasures being announced ahead of
OL,10,FWednesday's Budget.
OL,12,FThe BBC understands the government will
OL,13,Falso freeze fuel duty again in the
OL,14,FBudget, while the Times reports it may
OL,15,Falso slow the pace of pay increases for
OL,16,Fyounger workers on the minimum wage.
OL,18,FThe series of small announcements are
OL,19,Fpart of Chancellor John Healey's pledge
OL,20,Fto give families what he is calling
OL,21,F"breathing space" with the cost of
OL,22,Fliving.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
