OL,3,AStorm Boelo leaves thousands without
OL,4,Apower as Met Office issues new wind
OL,5,Awarning
OL,6,
OL,7,FA clean-up operation is under way in
OL,8,Fparts of the UK after Storm Boelo
OL,9,Fcaused flooding and property damage,
OL,10,Fleaving thousands without power.
OL,12,FThe Energy Networks Association (ENA)
OL,13,Fsaid around 22,600 properties were
OL,14,Fstill without power.
OL,16,FTwo men were killed by falling trees
OL,17,Fduring the storm on Sunday - a man in
OL,18,Fhis 20s whose car was hit in north
OL,19,FLondon and a 60-year-old man in
OL,20,FDumfries and Galloway identified as
OL,21,FRichard Baines, the long-serving
OL,22,Fcurator of Logan Botanic Garden.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
