OL,3,AStorm Boelo leaves thousands without
OL,4,Apower as Met Office issues new wind
OL,5,Awarning
OL,6,
OL,7,FA yellow warning for strong winds came
OL,8,Fin effect on Monday evening across the
OL,9,Fwest coast of England, Wales and
OL,10,FScotland and eastern parts of Northern
OL,11,FIreland and expired on Tuesday morning.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
